	)
	(text "J2 (1=GND, 2=5V, 3=CAM-TX/RX2, 4=CAM-RX/D23): camera UART. J9: OLED externo. U5: mic I2S. J4/J5: 1=GND, 2=5V, 3=sinal. C1..C4: filtragem."
